NOTE [label=<<B>Rule: who can see a seller’s mobile number</B><BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>The mobile number is an attribute of USER. A student can see it only if they are<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>interested, meaning they have started a CONVERSATION (STARTS) about that<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>seller’s LISTING (ABOUT). Everyone else never sees it.<BR ALIGN="LEFT"/>> shape=box style="rounded,dashed" fontsize=12 margin="0.2,0.12" pos="41,-3.2!"];
